"حدد المقابل 7 والمجاور 24 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the opposite 7 and adjacent 24 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{7}{24}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{7}{24}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{7}{24}$","En":"$\\frac{7}{24}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقلب الكسر أو تستعمل ضلعاً آخر.","En":"Do not invert the ratio or use another side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{O}{A}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{7}{24}$","En":"$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{7}{24}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{7}{24}\\times24=7$","En":"$\\frac{7}{24}\\times24=7$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المجاور على الوتر، وهذا جيب التمام.","En":"This uses adjacent over hypotenuse, which is cosine."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$يرمز $O$ إلى طول المقابل و$A$ إلى المجاور غير الصفري.

$\tan\theta=\frac{O}{A}$

1. حدد المقابل 7 والمجاور 24 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\theta$.

2. كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\frac{7}{24}$.

$\tan\theta=\frac{7}{24}$

$\frac{7}{24}$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{7}{24}\times24=7$

لا تقلب الكسر أو تستعمل ضلعاً آخر.$mw$,$mw$Let $O$ denote the opposite length and $A$ the nonzero adjacent length.

$\tan\theta=\frac{O}{A}$

1. Identify the opposite 7 and adjacent 24 relative to $\theta$.

2. Form the ratio in the correct order: $\frac{7}{24}$.

$\tan\theta=\frac{7}{24}$

$\frac{7}{24}$ Dimensionless

$\frac{7}{24}\times24=7$

Do not invert the ratio or use another side.$mw$),
(518,310,$mw$B06AF0019B72FD38F8C4654B080B2A682657629334F331882D529B6A1FBD240F$mw$,$mw$256a0ca073e320b1896b6ffb4b2ca8f4$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":310,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 60°؟","TitleEn":"Find the exact sine of angle 60°.","QuestionTextAr":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 60°؟","QuestionTextEn":"Find the exact sine of angle 60°.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: في مثلث 30°–60°–90° تكون أطوال الضلع المقابل لـ60° والوتر بنسبة √3 : 2. من قانون الجيب = المقابل ÷ الوتر نجد sin(60°) = √3/2. تُستنتج النسبة من فيثاغورس بأضلاع 1 و√3 ووتر 2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Special-triangle rule: The side opposite 60° in a 30°–60°–90° triangle is √3 when the hypotenuse is 2. Sine = opposite/hypotenuse, so sin(60°) = √3/2. The side ratios follow from Pythagoras with legs 1 and √3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1229,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1230,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"0","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1231,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{2}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1232,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم دائرة الوحدة ذات نصف القطر 1.","En":"Use the unit circle with radius 1."},{"Ar":"حدد الإحداثي الرأسي $y$ للنقطة عند الزاوية المعطاة.","En":"Identify the vertical coordinate $y$ at the given angle."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 60°؟","En":"Find the exact sine of angle 60°."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 0 درجة، لا 60 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 0 degrees, not 60; check the vertical coordinate."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"0"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 30 درجة، لا 60 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 30 degrees, not 60; check the vertical coordinate."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{1}{2}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 45 درجة، لا 60 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 45 degrees, not 60; check the vertical coordinate."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما القيمة الدقيقة لجيب الزاوية 60°؟","En":"Find the exact sine of angle 60°."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الجيب هو الإحداثي الصادي لنقطة الزاوية على دائرة الوحدة.","En":"Sine is the y-coordinate of the angle's point on the unit circle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"النقطة عند زاوية 60 درجة على دائرة الوحدة هي $(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})$.","En":"The point at 60 degrees on the unit circle is $(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})$."},{"Ar":"جيب الزاوية هو الإحداثي $y$، أي $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$.","En":"Sine is the $y$ coordinate, namely $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$","En":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل جيب 30 درجة بدلاً من جيب 60.","En":"Do not use sine of 30 degrees instead."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sin\\theta=y,\\quad (x,y)=(\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\sin60^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","En":"$\\sin60^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"تحقق من $(\\frac{1}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^2=1$ مع موضع الزاوية في الربع الأول أو على محوره.","En":"Check $(\\frac{1}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^2=1$ and the angle's location in or on the boundary of the first quadrant."}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":46,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم دائرة الوحدة ذات نصف القطر 1.","En":"Use the unit circle with radius 1."},{"Ar":"حدد الإحداثي الرأسي $y$ للنقطة عند الزاوية المعطاة.","En":"Identify the vertical coordinate $y$ at the given angle."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الجيب هو الإحداثي الصادي لنقطة الزاوية على دائرة الوحدة.","En":"Sine is the y-coordinate of the angle's point on the unit circle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"النقطة عند زاوية 60 درجة على دائرة الوحدة هي $(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})$.","En":"The point at 60 degrees on the unit circle is $(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})$."},{"Ar":"جيب الزاوية هو الإحداثي $y$، أي $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$.","En":"Sine is the $y$ coordinate, namely $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$","En":"$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل جيب 30 درجة بدلاً من جيب 60.","En":"Do not use sine of 30 degrees instead."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sin\\theta=y,\\quad (x,y)=(\\cos\\theta,\\sin\\theta)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\sin60^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$","En":"$\\sin60^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"تحقق من $(\\frac{1}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^2=1$ مع موضع الزاوية في الربع الأول أو على محوره.","En":"Check $(\\frac{1}{2})^2+(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^2=1$ and the angle's location in or on the boundary of the first quadrant."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 0 درجة، لا 60 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 0 degrees, not 60; check the vertical coordinate."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 30 درجة، لا 60 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 30 degrees, not 60; check the vertical coordinate."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذه قيمة جيب زاوية 45 درجة، لا 60 درجة؛ راجع الإحداثي الرأسي.","En":"This is the sine of 45 degrees, not 60; check the vertical coordinate."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الجيب هو الإحداثي الصادي لنقطة الزاوية على دائرة الوحدة.

$\sin\theta=y,\quad (x,y)=(\cos\theta,\sin\theta)$

1. النقطة عند زاوية 60 درجة على دائرة الوحدة هي $(\frac{1}{2},\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2})$.

2. جيب الزاوية هو الإحداثي $y$، أي $\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$.

$\sin60^\circ=\frac{\sqrt3}{2}$

$\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$ بلا وحدة قياس

تحقق من $(\frac{1}{2})^2+(\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2})^2=1$ مع موضع الزاوية في الربع الأول أو على محوره.

لا تستعمل جيب 30 درجة بدلاً من جيب 60.$mw$,$mw$Sine is the y-coordinate of the angle's point on the unit circle.

$\sin\theta=y,\quad (x,y)=(\cos\theta,\sin\theta)$

1. The point at 60 degrees on the unit circle is $(\frac{1}{2},\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2})$.

2. Sine is the $y$ coordinate, namely $\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$.

$\sin60^\circ=\frac{\sqrt3}{2}$

$\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$ Dimensionless

Check $(\frac{1}{2})^2+(\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2})^2=1$ and the angle's location in or on the boundary of the first quadrant.

Do not use sine of 30 degrees instead.$mw$),
(519,311,$mw$562ACB66523CC30679D381EEADCEC59C9C9B03BF8113684D6F51232D43089D23$mw$,$mw$50c8771c35a37a70aa4bbce048417dde$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":311,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"أوجد \\(f'(5)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\).","TitleEn":"Find f'(5) for \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\).","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد \\(f'(5)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Find f'(5) for \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مشتقة أ س^ن هي أ ن س^(ن−1). في f(س) = 6س^6 تكون f'(س) = 6 × 6س^5 = 36س^5. عند س = 5 نحسب f'(5) = 36 × 5^5 = 36 × 3125 = 112500. نشتق أولاً ثم نعوّض بقيمة س.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Power rule: d(ax^n)/dx = anx^(n−1). For f(x) = 6x^6, f'(x) = 6 × 6x^5 = 36x^5. Then f'(5) = 36 × 5^5 = 36 × 3125 = 112500. Differentiate first, then substitute the given x.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1233,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"112498","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1234,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"112500","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1235,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"112501","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1236,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"112503","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اشتق الدالة قبل التعويض.","En":"Differentiate before substituting."},{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة ثم عوّض المدخل المحدد.","En":"Apply the power rule, then substitute the given input."}],"Title":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(5)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\).","En":"Find f'(5) for \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 36 في 3125؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 36 times 3125; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"112498"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"112500"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 36 في 3125؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 36 times 3125; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"112501"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 36 في 3125؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 36 times 3125; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"112503"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد \\(f'(5)\\) للدالة \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\).","En":"Find f'(5) for \\(f(x)=6x^{6}\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة: نضرب المعامل بالأس وننقص الأس واحداً.","En":"Power rule: multiply coefficient by exponent and reduce exponent by one."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=36x^{5}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=36x^{5}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=5$: $36\\times5^{5}=112500$.","En":"Substitute $x=5$: $36\\times5^{5}=112500$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$112500$","En":"$112500$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية بدل المشتقة.","En":"Do not substitute into the original function rather than its derivative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=36x^{5},\\quad f'(5)=36\\times5^{5}=112500$","En":"$f'(x)=36x^{5},\\quad f'(5)=36\\times5^{5}=112500$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5^{5}=3125,\\quad36\\times3125=112500$","En":"$5^{5}=3125,\\quad36\\times3125=112500$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":49,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اشتق الدالة قبل التعويض.","En":"Differentiate before substituting."},{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة ثم عوّض المدخل المحدد.","En":"Apply the power rule, then substitute the given input."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة القوة: نضرب المعامل بالأس وننقص الأس واحداً.","En":"Power rule: multiply coefficient by exponent and reduce exponent by one."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=36x^{5}$.","En":"Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=36x^{5}$."},{"Ar":"عوّض $x=5$: $36\\times5^{5}=112500$.","En":"Substitute $x=5$: $36\\times5^{5}=112500$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$112500$","En":"$112500$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية بدل المشتقة.","En":"Do not substitute into the original function rather than its derivative."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$f'(x)=36x^{5},\\quad f'(5)=36\\times5^{5}=112500$","En":"$f'(x)=36x^{5},\\quad f'(5)=36\\times5^{5}=112500$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5^{5}=3125,\\quad36\\times3125=112500$","En":"$5^{5}=3125,\\quad36\\times3125=112500$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 36 في 3125؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 36 times 3125; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 36 في 3125؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 36 times 3125; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الخيار لا يساوي حاصل ضرب معامل المشتقة 36 في 3125؛ أعد حساب القوة والضرب.","En":"This choice is not the derivative coefficient 36 times 3125; recheck exponentiation and multiplication."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قاعدة القوة: نضرب المعامل بالأس وننقص الأس واحداً.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. طبق قاعدة القوة: $f'(x)=36x^{5}$.

2. عوّض $x=5$: $36\times5^{5}=112500$.

$f'(x)=36x^{5},\quad f'(5)=36\times5^{5}=112500$

$112500$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5^{5}=3125,\quad36\times3125=112500$

لا تعوض في الدالة الأصلية بدل المشتقة.$mw$,$mw$Power rule: multiply coefficient by exponent and reduce exponent by one.

$\frac{d}{dx}(ax^n)=anx^{n-1}$

1. Apply the power rule: $f'(x)=36x^{5}$.

2. Substitute $x=5$: $36\times5^{5}=112500$.

$f'(x)=36x^{5},\quad f'(5)=36\times5^{5}=112500$

$112500$ Dimensionless

$5^{5}=3125,\quad36\times3125=112500$

Do not substitute into the original function rather than its derivative.$mw$),
(520,312,$mw$9C4F4312E119257C20DAB0D5AC23DD7F669BC1D3E0FAB0B6E559398A2225AF1C$mw$,$mw$621558aef02f7a627cd262f4cf3cf0e9$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":312,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\).","TitleEn":"Compute \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Compute \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون التكامل غير المحدد للقوى: ∫أ س^ن dس = أ × س^(ن+1)/(ن+1) + C، ما دام ن ≠ −1. لدينا ∫25س^4 dس، نزيد الأس إلى 5 ونقسم المعامل على 5: (25/5)س^5 + C = 5س^5 + C. نضيف ثابت التكامل C لأن التكامل غير محدد.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Indefinite power-integration rule: ∫a x^n dx = a x^(n+1)/(n+1) + C when n ≠ −1. For ∫25x^4 dx, raise the exponent to 5 and divide the coefficient by 5: (25/5)x^5 + C = 5x^5 + C. Include integration constant C.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1237,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"5x^{5}+C","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1238,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"25x^{5}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1239,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"5x^{4}+C","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1240,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"25x^{4}+C","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة التكامل للقوى.","En":"Use the integration power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Raise the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"5x^{5}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $125x^{4}$ لا $25x^{4}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $125x^{4}$, not $25x^{4}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"25x^{5}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $20x^{3}$ لا $25x^{4}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $20x^{3}$, not $25x^{4}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5x^{4}+C"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $100x^{3}$ لا $25x^{4}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $100x^{3}$, not $25x^{4}$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"25x^{4}+C"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\).","En":"Compute \\(\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد عكس الاشتقاق؛ نزيد الأس ونقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: raise the power and divide the coefficient by the new power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 4 إلى 5؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 4 to 5; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 25 على 5 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 25 by 5 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5x^{5}+C$","En":"$5x^{5}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو القسمة.","En":"Do not omit the integration constant or division."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx=\\frac{25}{5}x^{5}+C$","En":"$\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx=\\frac{25}{5}x^{5}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(5x^{5}+C)'=25x^{4}$","En":"$(5x^{5}+C)'=25x^{4}$"}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":50,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة التكامل للقوى.","En":"Use the integration power rule."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأس واحداً ثم اقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Raise the exponent by one and divide the coefficient by the new exponent."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التكامل غير المحدد عكس الاشتقاق؛ نزيد الأس ونقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.","En":"Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: raise the power and divide the coefficient by the new power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"ارفع الأس 4 إلى 5؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\\ne-1$.","En":"Raise exponent 4 to 5; the power rule applies because $n\\ne-1$."},{"Ar":"اقسم المعامل 25 على 5 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.","En":"Divide coefficient 25 by 5 and add integration constant $C$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5x^{5}+C$","En":"$5x^{5}+C$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو القسمة.","En":"Do not omit the integration constant or division."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int ax^n\\,dx=\\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\\quad(n\\ne-1)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx=\\frac{25}{5}x^{5}+C$","En":"$\\int 25x^{4}\\,dx=\\frac{25}{5}x^{5}+C$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(5x^{5}+C)'=25x^{4}$","En":"$(5x^{5}+C)'=25x^{4}$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $125x^{4}$ لا $25x^{4}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $125x^{4}$, not $25x^{4}$."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $20x^{3}$ لا $25x^{4}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $20x^{3}$, not $25x^{4}$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"مشتقة هذا الخيار هي $100x^{3}$ لا $25x^{4}$.","En":"This option differentiates to $100x^{3}$, not $25x^{4}$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التكامل غير المحدد عكس الاشتقاق؛ نزيد الأس ونقسم المعامل على الأس الجديد.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. ارفع الأس 4 إلى 5؛ قاعدة القوة صالحة لأن $n\ne-1$.

2. اقسم المعامل 25 على 5 وأضف ثابت التكامل $C$.

$\int 25x^{4}\,dx=\frac{25}{5}x^{5}+C$

$5x^{5}+C$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(5x^{5}+C)'=25x^{4}$

لا تنس ثابت التكامل أو القسمة.$mw$,$mw$Indefinite integration reverses differentiation: raise the power and divide the coefficient by the new power.

$\int ax^n\,dx=\frac{a}{n+1}x^{n+1}+C\quad(n\ne-1)$

1. Raise exponent 4 to 5; the power rule applies because $n\ne-1$.

2. Divide coefficient 25 by 5 and add integration constant $C$.

$\int 25x^{4}\,dx=\frac{25}{5}x^{5}+C$

$5x^{5}+C$ Dimensionless

$(5x^{5}+C)'=25x^{4}$

Do not omit the integration constant or division.$mw$),
(521,313,$mw$BC4B3704E8A5136D36DABED682E0B19407C7C0FC01130EAB44B3A7CDBFE884B0$mw$,$mw$8fde985294c9ed73462d771d6eeb0f39$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":313,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":11,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\).","TitleEn":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مبرهنة التكامل الأساسية؛ التكامل المحدد من 0 إلى 6 للدالة 10t يساوي F(6) − F(0)، حيث F(t) = (10/2)t² = 5t². بالتعويض: 5 × 6² − 5 × 0² = 5 × 36 = 180.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Fundamental Theorem of Calculus: Evaluate ∫₀^6 10t dt as F(6) − F(0), where F(t) = (10/2)t² = 5t². Substitute: 5 × 6² − 5 × 0² = 5 × 36 = 180.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1241,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"181","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1242,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"183","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1243,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"178","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1244,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"180","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"أوجد الدالة الأصلية أولاً.","En":"Find the antiderivative first."},{"Ar":"عوّض الحدين في الدالة الأصلية واطرح.","En":"Evaluate both bounds in the antiderivative and subtract."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\).","En":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 6 والارتفاع 60؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 6 and height 60; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"181"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 6 والارتفاع 60؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 6 and height 60; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"183"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 6 والارتفاع 60؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 6 and height 60; check both bounds."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"178"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"180"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\).","En":"Evaluate \\(\\int_0^{6} 10t\\,dt\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية تطرح قيمة الدالة الأصلية عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"The fundamental theorem subtracts the antiderivative at the lower bound from its value at the upper bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=5t^2$.","En":"An antiderivative is $F(t)=5t^2$."},{"Ar":"احسب الفرق: $F(6)-F(0)=5\\times6^2=180$.","En":"Evaluate the difference: $F(6)-F(0)=5\\times6^2=180$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$180$","En":"$180$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك ثابت تكامل في الناتج المحدد.","En":"Do not leave an integration constant in a definite integral."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt=F(b)-F(a)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\left[5t^2\\right]_0^{6}=5(6^2-0)=180$","En":"$\\left[5t^2\\right]_0^{6}=5(6^2-0)=180$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مشتقة $F$ هي $10t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\\frac12\\times6\\times60=180$.","En":"The derivative of $F$ is $10t$; the triangular area is $\\frac12\\times6\\times60=180$."}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":11,"PrimarySkillId":51,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"أوجد الدالة الأصلية أولاً.","En":"Find the antiderivative first."},{"Ar":"عوّض الحدين في الدالة الأصلية واطرح.","En":"Evaluate both bounds in the antiderivative and subtract."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية تطرح قيمة الدالة الأصلية عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"The fundamental theorem subtracts the antiderivative at the lower bound from its value at the upper bound."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=5t^2$.","En":"An antiderivative is $F(t)=5t^2$."},{"Ar":"احسب الفرق: $F(6)-F(0)=5\\times6^2=180$.","En":"Evaluate the difference: $F(6)-F(0)=5\\times6^2=180$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$180$","En":"$180$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك ثابت تكامل في الناتج المحدد.","En":"Do not leave an integration constant in a definite integral."},"FormulaLatex":"\\int_a^b f(t)\\,dt=F(b)-F(a)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\left[5t^2\\right]_0^{6}=5(6^2-0)=180$","En":"$\\left[5t^2\\right]_0^{6}=5(6^2-0)=180$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مشتقة $F$ هي $10t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\\frac12\\times6\\times60=180$.","En":"The derivative of $F$ is $10t$; the triangular area is $\\frac12\\times6\\times60=180$."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 6 والارتفاع 60؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 6 and height 60; check both bounds."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 6 والارتفاع 60؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 6 and height 60; check both bounds."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا الناتج لا يساوي مساحة المثلث ذي القاعدة 6 والارتفاع 60؛ راجع التعويض في الحدين.","En":"This is not the triangular area with base 6 and height 60; check both bounds."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مبرهنة التفاضل والتكامل الأساسية تطرح قيمة الدالة الأصلية عند الحد الأدنى من الأعلى.

$\int_a^b f(t)\,dt=F(b)-F(a)$

1. دالة أصلية للتعبير هي $F(t)=5t^2$.

2. احسب الفرق: $F(6)-F(0)=5\times6^2=180$.

$\left[5t^2\right]_0^{6}=5(6^2-0)=180$

$180$ بلا وحدة قياس

مشتقة $F$ هي $10t$، ومساحة المثلث تحت المستقيم تساوي $\frac12\times6\times60=180$.

لا تترك ثابت تكامل في الناتج المحدد.$mw$,$mw$The fundamental theorem subtracts the antiderivative at the lower bound from its value at the upper bound.

$\int_a^b f(t)\,dt=F(b)-F(a)$

1. An antiderivative is $F(t)=5t^2$.

2. Evaluate the difference: $F(6)-F(0)=5\times6^2=180$.

$\left[5t^2\right]_0^{6}=5(6^2-0)=180$

$180$ Dimensionless

The derivative of $F$ is $10t$; the triangular area is $\frac12\times6\times60=180$.

Do not leave an integration constant in a definite integral.$mw$),
(522,314,$mw$D14E4E7709A3C38F29E6C87A5BEC4FE81EDE594397F4B4DDB493A5C03A1E97B3$mw$,$mw$fcf43867fdee03674d9f6ce186e2edaf$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":314,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":12,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 7 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","TitleEn":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 7 students?","QuestionTextAr":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 7 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","QuestionTextEn":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 7 students?","DetailedSolutionAr":"الاختيار دون ترتيب يُحسب بالتوافيق؛ نختار طالبين من 7، لذا $\\binom{7}{2}=\\frac{7\\times6}{2}=21$ طريقة.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Because order does not matter, use combinations: choosing two students from 7 gives $\\binom{7}{2}=\\frac{7\\times6}{2}=21$ ways.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1245,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"21","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1246,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"22","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1247,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"24","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1248,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"19","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"انتبه إلى أن ترتيب الطالبين غير مهم.","En":"The order of the students does not matter."},{"Ar":"احسب الاختيارات المرتبة لطالبين مختلفين ثم اقسم على اثنين.","En":"Count ordered selections of two distinct students and divide by two."}],"Title":{"Ar":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 7 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","En":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 7 students?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"21"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 44 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 42.","En":"This implies 44 ordered selections, but there are 42."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"22"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 48 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 42.","En":"This implies 48 ordered selections, but there are 42."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"24"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 38 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 42.","En":"This implies 38 ordered selections, but there are 42."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"19"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"كم طريقة لاختيار طالبين من 7 طلاب دون ترتيب؟","En":"How many unordered pairs can be selected from 7 students?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستخدم التوافيق لأن ترتيب الطالبين لا يغيّر الزوج المختار.","En":"Use combinations because swapping the students does not change the selected pair."},"Unit":{"Ar":"طريقة","En":"Ways"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"للاختيار الأول 7 إمكانات، وللثاني 6 بعد استبعاد الأول.","En":"There are 7 choices for the first student and 6 for the second, excluding the first."},{"Ar":"كل زوج غير مرتب يُعد مرتين؛ اقسم 42 على 2.","En":"Each unordered pair is counted twice; divide 42 by 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$21$","En":"$21$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعد الزوج نفسه مرتين.","En":"Do not count each pair twice."},"FormulaLatex":"\\binom n2=\\frac{n(n-1)}2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\binom{7}2=\\frac{7(7-1)}2=21$","En":"$\\binom{7}2=\\frac{7(7-1)}2=21$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$21\\times2=42$","En":"$21\\times2=42$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":12,"PrimarySkillId":56,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"انتبه إلى أن ترتيب الطالبين غير مهم.","En":"The order of the students does not matter."},{"Ar":"احسب الاختيارات المرتبة لطالبين مختلفين ثم اقسم على اثنين.","En":"Count ordered selections of two distinct students and divide by two."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نستخدم التوافيق لأن ترتيب الطالبين لا يغيّر الزوج المختار.","En":"Use combinations because swapping the students does not change the selected pair."},"Unit":{"Ar":"طريقة","En":"Ways"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"للاختيار الأول 7 إمكانات، وللثاني 6 بعد استبعاد الأول.","En":"There are 7 choices for the first student and 6 for the second, excluding the first."},{"Ar":"كل زوج غير مرتب يُعد مرتين؛ اقسم 42 على 2.","En":"Each unordered pair is counted twice; divide 42 by 2."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$21$","En":"$21$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعد الزوج نفسه مرتين.","En":"Do not count each pair twice."},"FormulaLatex":"\\binom n2=\\frac{n(n-1)}2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\binom{7}2=\\frac{7(7-1)}2=21$","En":"$\\binom{7}2=\\frac{7(7-1)}2=21$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$21\\times2=42$","En":"$21\\times2=42$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 44 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 42.","En":"This implies 44 ordered selections, but there are 42."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 48 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 42.","En":"This implies 48 ordered selections, but there are 42."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا العدد يقابل 38 اختياراً مرتباً، بينما العدد الصحيح للاختيارات المرتبة 42.","En":"This implies 38 ordered selections, but there are 42."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نستخدم التوافيق لأن ترتيب الطالبين لا يغيّر الزوج المختار.

$\binom n2=\frac{n(n-1)}2$

1. للاختيار الأول 7 إمكانات، وللثاني 6 بعد استبعاد الأول.

2. كل زوج غير مرتب يُعد مرتين؛ اقسم 42 على 2.

$\binom{7}2=\frac{7(7-1)}2=21$

$21$ طريقة

$21\times2=42$

لا تعد الزوج نفسه مرتين.$mw$,$mw$Use combinations because swapping the students does not change the selected pair.

$\binom n2=\frac{n(n-1)}2$

1. There are 7 choices for the first student and 6 for the second, excluding the first.

2. Each unordered pair is counted twice; divide 42 by 2.

$\binom{7}2=\frac{7(7-1)}2=21$

$21$ Ways

$21\times2=42$

Do not count each pair twice.$mw$),
(524,317,$mw$FA0B64466ECE01CEF881A116DFBAC00428AEC74DE72483745FE51799A462272A$mw$,$mw$28772e4e20c1ab4f4da093253b4e3f3f$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":317,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)؟","TitleEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)?","QuestionTextAr":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"قانون فييتا لمعادلة تربيعية أ س² + ب س + ج = 0: حاصل ضرب الجذرين = ج ÷ أ. في س² − 15س + 54 = 0 معامل س² هو 1 والحد الثابت 54، لذا حاصل الضرب = 54 ÷ 1 = 54. التحقق: التحليل (س − 6)(س − 9) يعطي الجذرين 6 و9 ومنتجهما 54.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Vieta's theorem: For ax² + bx + c = 0, the product of the two roots is c/a. In x² − 15x + 54 = 0, a = 1 and c = 54, so root product = 54/1 = 54. Check: factoring as (x − 6)(x − 9) yields roots 6, 9 with product 54.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1257,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"57","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1258,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"52","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1259,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"54","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1260,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"55","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد معاملات المعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Identify the quadratic coefficients."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل x².","En":"Divide the constant term by the coefficient of x squared."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)?"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 57 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 54.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 57 by it does not recover constant 54."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"57"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 52 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 54.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 52 by it does not recover constant 54."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"52"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"54"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 55 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 54.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 55 by it does not recover constant 54."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"55"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما حاصل ضرب جذري \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)؟","En":"What is the product of the roots of \\(x^2-15x+54=0\\)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حسب علاقات فييتا، حاصل ضرب الجذرين يساوي الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"By Vieta's formulas, the product of roots equals the constant divided by the leading coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=54$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=54$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{54}{1}=54$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{54}{1}=54$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$54$","En":"$54$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط حاصل الضرب مع مجموع الجذور.","En":"Do not confuse the root product with their sum."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{54}1=54$","En":"$\\frac{54}1=54$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-6)(x-9)=x^2-15x+54$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 54.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-6)(x-9)=x^2-15x+54$; the roots multiply to 54."}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":43,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد معاملات المعادلة التربيعية.","En":"Identify the quadratic coefficients."},{"Ar":"اقسم الحد الثابت على معامل x².","En":"Divide the constant term by the coefficient of x squared."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"حسب علاقات فييتا، حاصل ضرب الجذرين يساوي الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.","En":"By Vieta's formulas, the product of roots equals the constant divided by the leading coefficient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=54$.","En":"The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=54$."},{"Ar":"طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\\frac{54}{1}=54$.","En":"Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\\frac{54}{1}=54$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$54$","En":"$54$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط حاصل الضرب مع مجموع الجذور.","En":"Do not confuse the root product with their sum."},"FormulaLatex":"r_1r_2=\\frac{c}{a}\\quad(a\\ne0)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\frac{54}1=54$","En":"$\\frac{54}1=54$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"بالتفكيك: $(x-6)(x-9)=x^2-15x+54$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 54.","En":"Factoring gives $(x-6)(x-9)=x^2-15x+54$; the roots multiply to 54."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 57 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 54.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 57 by it does not recover constant 54."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 52 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 54.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 52 by it does not recover constant 54."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"معامل المربع يساوي 1؛ ضرب الخيار 55 في هذا المعامل لا يعيد الحد الثابت 54.","En":"The leading coefficient is 1; multiplying 55 by it does not recover constant 54."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$حسب علاقات فييتا، حاصل ضرب الجذرين يساوي الحد الثابت على معامل المربع.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. معامل $x^2$ هو $a=1$ والحد الثابت $c=54$.

2. طبق علاقة فييتا: $r_1r_2=\frac{54}{1}=54$.

$\frac{54}1=54$

$54$ بلا وحدة قياس

بالتفكيك: $(x-6)(x-9)=x^2-15x+54$، وحاصل ضرب الجذرين 54.

لا تخلط حاصل الضرب مع مجموع الجذور.$mw$,$mw$By Vieta's formulas, the product of roots equals the constant divided by the leading coefficient.

$r_1r_2=\frac{c}{a}\quad(a\ne0)$

1. The leading coefficient is $a=1$ and the constant is $c=54$.

2. Apply Vieta's relation: $r_1r_2=\frac{54}{1}=54$.

$\frac{54}1=54$

$54$ Dimensionless

Factoring gives $(x-6)(x-9)=x^2-15x+54$; the roots multiply to 54.

Do not confuse the root product with their sum.$mw$),
(525,318,$mw$92C192194B76BC97A33424FA57BE9982B0A9DCBA430A6468B2084E9A2C3435C8$mw$,$mw$d67086f39f6d2b62d8adeef98871f4c1$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":318,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\).","TitleEn":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\).","QuestionTextAr":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مميّز المعادلة التربيعية أ س² + ب س + ج = 0 هو Δ = ب² − 4أج. في س² + 6س + 7 = 0 لدينا أ = 1، ب = 6، ج = 7. بالتعويض: Δ = 6² − 4 × 1 × 7 = 36 − 28 = 8. إشارة المميز تساعد لاحقاً في تحديد عدد الجذور الحقيقية.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Quadratic discriminant law: For ax² + bx + c = 0, Δ = b² − 4ac. In x² + 6x + 7 = 0, a = 1, b = 6, c = 7. Substitute: Δ = 6² − 4 × 1 × 7 = 36 − 28 = 8. The discriminant sign can then classify real roots.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1261,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1262,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1263,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1264,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"11","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اكتب معاملات المعادلة الثلاثة.","En":"Write the three quadratic coefficients."},{"Ar":"ربّع معامل x ثم اطرح حاصل ضرب أربعة في المعامل الأول والثابت.","En":"Square the linear coefficient and subtract four times the product of leading and constant coefficients."}],"Title":{"Ar":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\).","En":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز 6 فإن إضافة $4ac=28$ تعطي 34 وليس $b^2=36$.","En":"If the discriminant were 6, adding $4ac=28$ would give 34, not $b^2=36$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز 9 فإن إضافة $4ac=28$ تعطي 37 وليس $b^2=36$.","En":"If the discriminant were 9, adding $4ac=28$ would give 37, not $b^2=36$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز 11 فإن إضافة $4ac=28$ تعطي 39 وليس $b^2=36$.","En":"If the discriminant were 11, adding $4ac=28$ would give 39, not $b^2=36$."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"11"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب مميز \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\).","En":"Compute the discriminant of \\(x^2+6x+7=0\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المميز يساوي مربع معامل الحد الخطي مطروحاً منه أربعة أمثال حاصل ضرب المعامل الأول والثابت.","En":"The discriminant is the square of the linear coefficient minus four times the product of the leading and constant coefficients."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=6$ و$c=7$.","En":"Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=6$ and $c=7$."},{"Ar":"احسب $b^2=36$ و$4ac=28$ ثم اطرح.","En":"Compute $b^2=36$ and $4ac=28$, then subtract."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"راعِ إشارة الطرح في المميز.","En":"Preserve subtraction in the discriminant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\Delta=b^2-4ac","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6^2-4(1)(7)=8$","En":"$6^2-4(1)(7)=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$8+28=36$","En":"$8+28=36$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":44,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اكتب معاملات المعادلة الثلاثة.","En":"Write the three quadratic coefficients."},{"Ar":"ربّع معامل x ثم اطرح حاصل ضرب أربعة في المعامل الأول والثابت.","En":"Square the linear coefficient and subtract four times the product of leading and constant coefficients."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المميز يساوي مربع معامل الحد الخطي مطروحاً منه أربعة أمثال حاصل ضرب المعامل الأول والثابت.","En":"The discriminant is the square of the linear coefficient minus four times the product of the leading and constant coefficients."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=6$ و$c=7$.","En":"Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=6$ and $c=7$."},{"Ar":"احسب $b^2=36$ و$4ac=28$ ثم اطرح.","En":"Compute $b^2=36$ and $4ac=28$, then subtract."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"راعِ إشارة الطرح في المميز.","En":"Preserve subtraction in the discriminant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\Delta=b^2-4ac","Substitution":{"Ar":"$6^2-4(1)(7)=8$","En":"$6^2-4(1)(7)=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$8+28=36$","En":"$8+28=36$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز 6 فإن إضافة $4ac=28$ تعطي 34 وليس $b^2=36$.","En":"If the discriminant were 6, adding $4ac=28$ would give 34, not $b^2=36$."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز 9 فإن إضافة $4ac=28$ تعطي 37 وليس $b^2=36$.","En":"If the discriminant were 9, adding $4ac=28$ would give 37, not $b^2=36$."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"إذا كان المميز 11 فإن إضافة $4ac=28$ تعطي 39 وليس $b^2=36$.","En":"If the discriminant were 11, adding $4ac=28$ would give 39, not $b^2=36$."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المميز يساوي مربع معامل الحد الخطي مطروحاً منه أربعة أمثال حاصل ضرب المعامل الأول والثابت.

$\Delta=b^2-4ac$

1. حدد المعاملات: $a=1$ و$b=6$ و$c=7$.

2. احسب $b^2=36$ و$4ac=28$ ثم اطرح.

$6^2-4(1)(7)=8$

$8$ بلا وحدة قياس

$8+28=36$

راعِ إشارة الطرح في المميز.$mw$,$mw$The discriminant is the square of the linear coefficient minus four times the product of the leading and constant coefficients.

$\Delta=b^2-4ac$

1. Identify coefficients $a=1$, $b=6$ and $c=7$.

2. Compute $b^2=36$ and $4ac=28$, then subtract.

$6^2-4(1)(7)=8$

$8$ Dimensionless

$8+28=36$

Preserve subtraction in the discriminant.$mw$),
(526,319,$mw$BDCA28C4C695013D4C545E76C9F8675D9445E8AA4D78044F5042868CA61947DB$mw$,$mw$79b22026b73fe96c273bd98ae0a6b2e0$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":319,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حلّل \\(x^2+13x+42\\) إلى عوامل.","TitleEn":"Factor \\(x^2+13x+42\\).","QuestionTextAr":"حلّل \\(x^2+13x+42\\) إلى عوامل.","QuestionTextEn":"Factor \\(x^2+13x+42\\).","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: لتحليل س² + 13س + 42 نبحث عن عددين مجموعهما 13 وحاصل ضربهما 42. العددان 6 و7 لأن 6 + 7 = 13 و6 × 7 = 42. إذن التحليل (س + 6)(س + 7). التحقق بالتوزيع: س² + (6 + 7)س + 6×7 يعيد المقدار الأصلي.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Factoring rule: To factor x² + 13x + 42, find two numbers with sum 13 and product 42. They are 6 and 7 because 6 + 7 = 13 and 6 × 7 = 42. Therefore the factors are (x + 6)(x + 7). Expanding reproduces x² + 13x + 42.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1265,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"(x+6)(x+7)","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1266,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"(x-6)(x-7)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1267,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"(x+6)(x-7)","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1268,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"(x+1)(x+42)","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن المعاملين الخطي والثابت بصورة حاصل ضرب عاملين.","En":"Compare the linear and constant coefficients with a product of two factors."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن عددين مجموعهما معامل x وحاصل ضربهما الحد الثابت.","En":"Find two numbers with sum equal to the linear coefficient and product equal to the constant."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حلّل \\(x^2+13x+42\\) إلى عوامل.","En":"Factor \\(x^2+13x+42\\)."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"(x+6)(x+7)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -13 والثابت 42؛ المطلوب 13 و42 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -13 and constant 42; both must instead be 13 and 42."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x-6)(x-7)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -1 والثابت -42؛ المطلوب 13 و42 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -1 and constant -42; both must instead be 13 and 42."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x+6)(x-7)"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو 43 والثابت 42؛ المطلوب 13 و42 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient 43 and constant 42; both must instead be 13 and 42."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"(x+1)(x+42)"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"حلّل \\(x^2+13x+42\\) إلى عوامل.","En":"Factor \\(x^2+13x+42\\)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تحليل ثلاثي حدود أحادي المعامل يستعمل شرط المجموع والجداء.","En":"Factoring a monic trinomial requires both the sum and product conditions."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 13 وحاصل ضربهما 42.","En":"Find two integers with sum 13 and product 42."},{"Ar":"العددان 6 و7 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+6)(x+7)$.","En":"The values 6 and 7 meet both conditions, so write $(x+6)(x+7)$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x+6)(x+7)$","En":"$(x+6)(x+7)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"تحقق من المجموع والجداء معاً.","En":"Verify both sum and product."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+13x+42=(x+6)(x+7)$","En":"$x^2+13x+42=(x+6)(x+7)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6+7=13,\\quad6\\times7=42$","En":"$6+7=13,\\quad6\\times7=42$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":45,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن المعاملين الخطي والثابت بصورة حاصل ضرب عاملين.","En":"Compare the linear and constant coefficients with a product of two factors."},{"Ar":"ابحث عن عددين مجموعهما معامل x وحاصل ضربهما الحد الثابت.","En":"Find two numbers with sum equal to the linear coefficient and product equal to the constant."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تحليل ثلاثي حدود أحادي المعامل يستعمل شرط المجموع والجداء.","En":"Factoring a monic trinomial requires both the sum and product conditions."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 13 وحاصل ضربهما 42.","En":"Find two integers with sum 13 and product 42."},{"Ar":"العددان 6 و7 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+6)(x+7)$.","En":"The values 6 and 7 meet both conditions, so write $(x+6)(x+7)$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$(x+6)(x+7)$","En":"$(x+6)(x+7)$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"تحقق من المجموع والجداء معاً.","En":"Verify both sum and product."},"FormulaLatex":"x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x^2+13x+42=(x+6)(x+7)$","En":"$x^2+13x+42=(x+6)(x+7)$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$6+7=13,\\quad6\\times7=42$","En":"$6+7=13,\\quad6\\times7=42$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -13 والثابت 42؛ المطلوب 13 و42 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -13 and constant 42; both must instead be 13 and 42."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو -1 والثابت -42؛ المطلوب 13 و42 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient -1 and constant -42; both must instead be 13 and 42."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"عند التوسيع يصبح معامل $x$ هو 43 والثابت 42؛ المطلوب 13 و42 معاً.","En":"Expansion gives linear coefficient 43 and constant 42; both must instead be 13 and 42."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$تحليل ثلاثي حدود أحادي المعامل يستعمل شرط المجموع والجداء.

$x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)$

1. نحتاج عددين مجموعهما 13 وحاصل ضربهما 42.

2. العددان 6 و7 يحققان الشرطين، لذا اكتب $(x+6)(x+7)$.

$x^2+13x+42=(x+6)(x+7)$

$(x+6)(x+7)$ بلا وحدة قياس

$6+7=13,\quad6\times7=42$

تحقق من المجموع والجداء معاً.$mw$,$mw$Factoring a monic trinomial requires both the sum and product conditions.

$x^2+(u+v)x+uv=(x+u)(x+v)$

1. Find two integers with sum 13 and product 42.

2. The values 6 and 7 meet both conditions, so write $(x+6)(x+7)$.

$x^2+13x+42=(x+6)(x+7)$

$(x+6)(x+7)$ Dimensionless

$6+7=13,\quad6\times7=42$

Verify both sum and product.$mw$),
(527,320,$mw$2B7700E267E62E16DD504712C27ECDC923EA2F5E6A44EEA55656F4E639B65EF6$mw$,$mw$795e764798a679342fd6a2bfe14cd9d8$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":320,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 40 والوتر 41، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","TitleEn":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 40, hypotenuse 41. Find cos θ.","QuestionTextAr":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 40 والوتر 41، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","QuestionTextEn":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 40, hypotenuse 41. Find cos θ.","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: cos(θ) = طول الضلع المجاور للزاوية ÷ طول الوتر في المثلث القائم. الضلع المجاور 40 والوتر 41؛ بالتعويض: cos(θ) = 40 ÷ 41 = 40/41. بما أن المجاور أقصر من الوتر فالنتيجة أقل من 1.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Right-triangle cosine rule: cos(θ) = adjacent side ÷ hypotenuse. With adjacent 40 and hypotenuse 41, substitute cos(θ) = 40/41. Since a triangle's leg is shorter than its hypotenuse, this positive ratio is below 1.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1269,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac{41}{40}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1270,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{40}{41}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1271,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{9}{41}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1272,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{9}{40}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد الضلعين بحسب موقعهما من الزاوية.","En":"Identify the sides relative to the angle."},{"Ar":"استعمل المجاور في البسط والوتر في المقام.","En":"Use adjacent as numerator and hypotenuse as denominator."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 40 والوتر 41، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","En":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 40, hypotenuse 41. Find cos θ."},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{41}{40}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{40}{41}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{9}{41}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على المجاور، وهذا ظل الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over adjacent, which is tangent."},"ErrorType":"operation-check","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{9}{40}"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"مجاور الزاوية θ في مثلث قائم 40 والوتر 41، أوجد \\(\\cos\\theta\\).","En":"Right triangle: adjacent to θ is 40, hypotenuse 41. Find cos θ."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"يرمز $A$ إلى طول المجاور و$H$ إلى الوتر، والوتر موجب.","En":"Let $A$ denote the adjacent length and $H$ the positive hypotenuse."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المجاور 40 والوتر 41 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the adjacent 40 and hypotenuse 41 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{40}{41}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{40}{41}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{40}{41}$","En":"$\\frac{40}{41}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقلب الكسر أو تستعمل ضلعاً آخر.","En":"Do not invert the ratio or use another side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{A}{H}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{40}{41}$","En":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{40}{41}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{40}{41}\\times41=40$","En":"$\\frac{40}{41}\\times41=40$"}},"TrackIds":[10],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":48,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد الضلعين بحسب موقعهما من الزاوية.","En":"Identify the sides relative to the angle."},{"Ar":"استعمل المجاور في البسط والوتر في المقام.","En":"Use adjacent as numerator and hypotenuse as denominator."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"يرمز $A$ إلى طول المجاور و$H$ إلى الوتر، والوتر موجب.","En":"Let $A$ denote the adjacent length and $H$ the positive hypotenuse."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"حدد المجاور 40 والوتر 41 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\\theta$.","En":"Identify the adjacent 40 and hypotenuse 41 relative to $\\theta$."},{"Ar":"كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\\frac{40}{41}$.","En":"Form the ratio in the correct order: $\\frac{40}{41}$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac{40}{41}$","En":"$\\frac{40}{41}$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقلب الكسر أو تستعمل ضلعاً آخر.","En":"Do not invert the ratio or use another side."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos\\theta=\\frac{A}{H}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{40}{41}$","En":"$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{40}{41}$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{40}{41}\\times41=40$","En":"$\\frac{40}{41}\\times41=40$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"قلبت البسط والمقام؛ هذه مقلوب النسبة المطلوبة.","En":"The numerator and denominator are reversed; this is the reciprocal."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على الوتر، وهذا جيب الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over hypotenuse, which is sine."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"operation-check","Reason":{"Ar":"استُخدم المقابل على المجاور، وهذا ظل الزاوية.","En":"This uses opposite over adjacent, which is tangent."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$يرمز $A$ إلى طول المجاور و$H$ إلى الوتر، والوتر موجب.

$\cos\theta=\frac{A}{H}$

1. حدد المجاور 40 والوتر 41 بالنسبة إلى الزاوية $\theta$.

2. كوّن النسبة بالترتيب الصحيح: $\frac{40}{41}$.

$\cos\theta=\frac{40}{41}$

$\frac{40}{41}$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{40}{41}\times41=40$

لا تقلب الكسر أو تستعمل ضلعاً آخر.$mw$,$mw$Let $A$ denote the adjacent length and $H$ the positive hypotenuse.

$\cos\theta=\frac{A}{H}$

1. Identify the adjacent 40 and hypotenuse 41 relative to $\theta$.

2. Form the ratio in the correct order: $\frac{40}{41}$.

$\cos\theta=\frac{40}{41}$

$\frac{40}{41}$ Dimensionless

$\frac{40}{41}\times41=40$

Do not invert the ratio or use another side.$mw$),
